<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 20.6 percent in the week ended September 13, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages increased 38.3 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 17.0 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 10.6 percent to 250.8 from 226.8 the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 4.8 percent to 179.9 in the latest survey from 188.9 in the previous week, it said.  </p>
